abstract: >-
  CCMAP localizes the key ideas and age-banded learning outcomes of UNESCO's
  Greening Curriculum Guidance (2024) into a national curriculum context
  (Taiwan implementation) and connects them to teaching resources through
  embedding-based semantic search over precomputed vectors. UNESCO-derived
  data are licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO (see data/LICENSE.md); this software is
  not endorsed by UNESCO.
